-- Rows of a used v1.0.0 control database, produced through the v1.0.0 HTTP
-- API on the local self-host provider: operator sign-in, one Organization,
-- operator-signed funding of 2000 minor units (`scripts/operator-key.ts
-- funding`), an API key, and one ObjectBucket Resource applied through
-- /apis/forms.takoform.com/v1alpha3 at the release's only Offering
-- (storage.object.standard, 500 minor per bucket-month). Its ledger therefore
-- holds funding, hold and capture rows. The token rows hold only digests of
-- throwaway secrets from a deleted scratch installation. See schema.sql for
-- provenance.
